    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d152">

                <pb facs="0196" n="104" xml:id="pg104"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to Prime Minister
                        Churchill</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d152-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tunis</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-11-21">21 November 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Personal and Secret for the Prime Minister from the President.</p>
                <p>Thank you very much for your messages Numbers 502,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d152-f2"
                    /> 503,<anchor n="3" xml:id="d152-f3"/> 504<anchor n="4" xml:id="d152-f4"/> and
                        505<anchor n="5" xml:id="d152-f5"/> which were delivered to me upon my
                    arrival early yesterday. I expect to reach <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Sextant</hi> early morning November twenty-second, and it will be grand to
                    see you again. I hope your cold is better.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
